## ✅ Part B — Responsible AI Review Checklist

*Run before go-live and at each material change. Every item is Pass / Fail / N-A with evidence. Any Fail in a 🔴 domain blocks release.*

### Domain 1 — Documentation & Traceability
- [ ] Model card exists, is current, and is versioned
- [ ] AIA (Day 35) completed with a recorded decision
- [ ] Risks logged in the register (Day 34) with owners

### Domain 2 — Data Governance 🔴
- [ ] Data provenance and licensing verified
- [ ] Personal data has a legal basis; special-category data justified
- [ ] Data minimization applied; retention/deletion defined

### Domain 3 — Fairness & Non-Discrimination 🔴
- [ ] Fairness tested across protected groups (not just aggregate accuracy)
- [ ] Disparate-impact result within agreed threshold
- [ ] Mitigations documented for known biases

### Domain 4 — Robustness & Reliability
- [ ] Performance meets defined threshold on realistic data
- [ ] Adversarial / edge-case testing done (incl. prompt-injection eval for LLMs)
- [ ] Drift monitoring and alerting in place

### Domain 5 — Transparency & Explainability 🔴
- [ ] Affected people can be told a decision was AI-assisted (where required)
- [ ] A decision can be explained in plain language
- [ ] Users are not deceived about interacting with AI (EU AI Act Art. 50)

### Domain 6 — Human Oversight 🔴
- [ ] Meaningful human review exists for consequential decisions
- [ ] Reviewer has context, time, and authority to override
- [ ] Kill-switch / rollback tested

### Domain 7 — Security & Privacy 🔴
- [ ] Threat model reviewed (see Day 37 series / OWASP LLM Top 10)
- [ ] Access controls, logging, and secrets management verified
- [ ] No sensitive data leakage via outputs or logs

### Domain 8 — Legal & Regulatory
- [ ] EU AI Act classification confirmed; obligations met for the tier
- [ ] Sector-specific rules checked (finance, health, employment)
- [ ] IP/copyright of training data and outputs assessed

### Domain 9 — Monitoring & Lifecycle
- [ ] Production monitoring (quality, fairness, drift, abuse) defined
- [ ] Incident response path defined (Day 37)
- [ ] Re-review triggers and owner assigned

