## 🤖 GenAI / LLM Supplement

Classic model cards assume a trained model you control. Foundation-model apps need extra fields:

- **Prompt & system-message versioning** — the prompt *is* part of the model behavior; version it
- **Vendor model pinning** — record exact model version; vendor updates change behavior silently
- **RAG source freshness & scoping** — what the model can retrieve, and per-tenant isolation
- **Guardrail stack** — input filters, output filters, refusal behavior, jailbreak resistance
- **Eval suite** — hallucination rate, prompt-injection resistance, toxicity, task accuracy — run in CI
- **Data-use terms** — does the vendor train on your inputs? (contractual no-train clause)

