## 🧑‍⚖️ Sign-off RACI

| Decision | Model Owner | AI Gov Lead | Security | Legal/DPO | Gov Board |
|----------|:-----------:|:-----------:|:--------:|:---------:|:---------:|
| Model card complete | **R** | A | C | C | I |
| RAI checklist run | C | **R/A** | C | C | I |
| Tier 2 go-live | R | **A** | C | C | I |
| Tier 1 (high-risk) go-live | R | R | C | C | **A** |

*R = Responsible, A = Accountable, C = Consulted, I = Informed*

